      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The concept of an obsessive-compulsive spectrum of disorders has become useful. This article reviews what has been learned about these conditions (especially in the last few years), and how this information may be helpful to clinicians and researchers who work with patients with chronic nonmalignant pain."},
